  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, studied combat class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create a mandate that you share with another ally, they benefit from your studied combat ability, receiving the same bonuses you do against the same target. If you possess abilities that trigger from studied combat (such as studied strike), they may trigger that ability as well. Only one ally (other than yourself) can benefit from your studied combat this way.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/war#toc112\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
